# um-texts 1
=== MATERIAL Alloy
Meteorite Alloy
A new and expensive metal, few are those able to forge such material.

=== MATERIAL Black
Tempered leather
Tempered leather, known for its exceptional strength and durability, but very rare.

=== MATERIAL Blue_Lizard
Blue Lizard hide
Versatile and relatively easy to find.

