Corundum
The best material for stone weapons, capable of carrying powerfull spells.

=== MATERIAL Green_Lizard
Green Lizard hide
Cheap and common, low quality.

=== MATERIAL Hyena_Hide
Hyena hide
Tough, reliable, and widely available.

=== MATERIAL Jade
Jade
A gemstone capable of casting spells.

=== MATERIAL Jute
Jute
A rough, scratchy fabric barely suitable for clothing. Cheap and disposable, just like those who wear it.

=== MATERIAL Malachite
Obsidian
One of the best materials for stone weapons.

=== MATERIAL Wolf_Hide
Wolf skin
Durable but not very effective.

